{"4218620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Double Dealers", "steam_appid": 4218620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4750320, 5140360], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/019a273d5766a9c91a6bf7bd9c5a8be7.avif?t=1787905439\" width=867 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/99f07ca574bd07e9a3a70f4f261a808e.poster.avif?t=1787905439\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/99f07ca574bd07e9a3a70f4f261a808e.webm?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/99f07ca574bd07e9a3a70f4f261a808e.mp4?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a 3 to 6 player trading game built on bluffing, manipulation, and social strategy. Every round, one player becomes the seller and only they know the full truth about what they are offering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player starts with three items and must choose one to auction.<br>The seller can see the item’s real market value along with two hidden Clauses attached to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The buyers cannot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it a bargain?<br>Or a disaster waiting to explode?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through real-time negotiation, players pressure, bluff, and outbid each other in fast-paced auctions. When the timer ends, the item is sold and the truth is revealed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/cbe4d742b1fc748ae7e34286c4bd2ee8.avif?t=1787905439\" width=867 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/9f6cb474120e5832565ea5a70d70e709.poster.avif?t=1787905439\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/9f6cb474120e5832565ea5a70d70e709.webm?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/9f6cb474120e5832565ea5a70d70e709.mp4?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item comes with two randomized Clauses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They might be beneficial.<br>They might be harmful.<br>They might completely shift the balance of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clauses can reward bold plays or create unexpected consequences, turning what looked like a perfect deal into a costly mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two auctions feel the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/237ce7f67917d9bbf2449431603b1239.avif?t=1787905439\" width=867 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/d759033c3cf29b4faff0c0c5a1eae749.poster.avif?t=1787905439\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/d759033c3cf29b4faff0c0c5a1eae749.webm?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/d759033c3cf29b4faff0c0c5a1eae749.mp4?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each player has taken their turn as seller, the game moves into the Market phase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, players decide whether to sell immediately for secure profit or hold onto items for potential bonuses. Timing, greed, and risk management all matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunes can rise or collapse in seconds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/faf50e61711e23073db0be972d8ff339.avif?t=1787905439\" width=867 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/ac998e2fcbdcd86785fb1179ed3a29b6.poster.avif?t=1787905439\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/ac998e2fcbdcd86785fb1179ed3a29b6.webm?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/ac998e2fcbdcd86785fb1179ed3a29b6.mp4?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the Market phase, players may choose to invest in powerful Cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards allow you to shape the game in your favor, strengthen your own position, or disrupt your opponents. Use them wisely to gain long-term advantages or create critical turning points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system is optional, but the strategic depth it adds can change everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/07fd2743c92e1469473a21dfc8366c77.avif?t=1787905439\" width=867 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/3176d638c5f064ce3f3a4641383b8537.poster.avif?t=1787905439\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/3176d638c5f064ce3f3a4641383b8537.webm?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/3176d638c5f064ce3f3a4641383b8537.mp4?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just about numbers.<br>It is about reading the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convince others your item is priceless.<br>Hide dangerous risks behind confidence.<br>Form temporary alliances.<br>Break them when it benefits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for chaotic friend groups and intense mind games.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/019a273d5766a9c91a6bf7bd9c5a8be7.avif?t=1787905439\" width=867 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/99f07ca574bd07e9a3a70f4f261a808e.poster.avif?t=1787905439\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/99f07ca574bd07e9a3a70f4f261a808e.webm?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/99f07ca574bd07e9a3a70f4f261a808e.mp4?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a 3 to 6 player trading game built on bluffing, manipulation, and social strategy. Every round, one player becomes the seller and only they know the full truth about what they are offering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player starts with three items and must choose one to auction.<br>The seller can see the item’s real market value along with two hidden Clauses attached to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The buyers cannot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it a bargain?<br>Or a disaster waiting to explode?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through real-time negotiation, players pressure, bluff, and outbid each other in fast-paced auctions. When the timer ends, the item is sold and the truth is revealed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/cbe4d742b1fc748ae7e34286c4bd2ee8.avif?t=1787905439\" width=867 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/9f6cb474120e5832565ea5a70d70e709.poster.avif?t=1787905439\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/9f6cb474120e5832565ea5a70d70e709.webm?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218620/extras/9f6cb474120e5832565ea5a70d70e709.mp4?t=1787905439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item comes with two randomized Clauses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They might be beneficial.<br>They might be harmful.<br>They might completely shift the balance of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clauses can reward bold plays or create unexpected consequences, turning what looked like a perfect deal into a costly mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap